{"title": "Aura of Murder (passive feature)", "pageid": 27742, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (disambiguation)\">Aura of Murder (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Aura_of_Murder.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Aura_of_Murder.webp/300px-Aura_of_Murder.webp, /w/images/1/14/Aura_of_Murder.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Aura_of_Murder.webp/300px-Aura_of_Murder.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Aura_of_Murder.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Aura of Murder</b> is a toggleable passive feature. It creates an aura which makes enemies Vulnerable to Piercing damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Enemies within 3 m (10 ft) become <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage, unless they are <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to it. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Murder_.28Bhaalist_Armour.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)\"> Condition: Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Murder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\">Aura of Murder</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Enemies within 3 m (10 ft) are <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to Piercing damage, unless they are <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaalist_Armour\" title=\"Bhaalist Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Bhaalist_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaalist_Armour\" title=\"Bhaalist Armour\">Bhaalist Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In patch 8, the radius was increased from 2 m (7 ft) to 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>It appears that partial piercing immunity, such as that possessed by <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cazador\">Cazador</a>, inhibits the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Murder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\">Aura of Murder</a> granted by this feature.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>It is possible for the Aura of Murder effect to disappear when travelling between the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>; this can be remedied by toggling the effect off and on in the passives tab of the hotbar.</li>\n<li>Due to the way <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistances</a> and immunities are handled, enemies resistant to Piercing damage only have their resistance removed (instead of being made vulnerable) by Aura of Murder. This effect does not stack with attacks that bypass piercing resistance, like those made while wearing the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Gloves\" title=\"Bonespike Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Gloves_Barbarian_Magic_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Gloves\" title=\"Bonespike Gloves\">Bonespike Gloves</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715095926\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2313/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24863/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9714/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 961714/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.988      1 -total\n 98.61%   54.225      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 21.99%   12.091     24 Template:Trim\n 21.72%   11.941      3 Template:Icon_link\n 20.94%   11.516      3 Template:Icon_text\n 17.37%    9.549      1 Template:DamageType\n 17.30%    9.514      2 Template:Item_icon\n 16.07%    8.834      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 15.69%    8.628      7 Template:Ifempty\n 14.91%    8.201      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27742-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715095926 and revision id 402740. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}